@* Applies to every page: the namespace of the classes the pages compile to, and the tag helpers (asp-for, asp-page and the rest).
   A page in a folder below this one is in a namespace named after the folder: Notes/Edit.cshtml is in Sample_WebApp.Pages.Notes,
   beside its EditModel, so its @model line names the class alone. *@
@namespace Sample_WebApp.Pages
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
